# Counterfactual: a hostile reader of the compensation record added
#
# The constitution plus one rule that conditions confinement on the absence of
# a promised wage. The engine accepts it — promise is a base relation with no
# negative cycle for the stratifier to refuse — and it derives. This fixture is
# the watched failing control for the purpose-limited-record guard on `promise`:
# the guard must reject this copy and accept the real constitution.
:expect-pins 4
? prisoner(Bela).
# => TRUE
? prisoner(Cira).
# => TRUE
promise(Firm, Wage, Bela).
? prisoner(Bela).
# => FALSE
? entitled(Cira, event { eats() }).
# => TRUE
